      "location": "data_trend",
      "fact": "The plotted line shows a consistent downward trajectory on the page from left to right. Because the y-axis is inverted, this downward movement on the page corresponds to an increase in the numerical value of 'doctors per 1,000 inhabitants' over time (from ~1.3 to ~2.4)."
    }
  ],
